					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Rule_Title</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>The Ubuntu operating system must enforce a delay of at least 4 seconds between logon prompts following a failed logon attempt.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Limiting the number of logon attempts over a certain time interval reduces the chances that an unauthorized user may gain access to an account.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
