					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify if the Ubuntu operating system is configured to audit the execution of the module management program "modprobe" by running the following command: 
 
$ sudo auditctl -l | grep "/sbin/modprobe" 
 
-w /sbin/modprobe -p x -k modules 
 
