Add or update the following rule in the "/etc/audit/rules.d/stig.rules" file: 
 
-w /bin/kmod -p x -k modules 
  
To reload the rules file, issue the following command: 
 
$ sudo augenrules --load</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
