				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify the system does not include other operating system installations.

Run "Advanced System Settings".
Select the "Advanced" tab.
Click the "Settings" button in the "Startup and Recovery" section.

If the drop-down list box "Default operating system:" shows any operating system other than Windows 10, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Ensure Windows 10 is the only operating system on a device.  Remove alternate operating systems.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
