				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Multiple network connections can provide additional attack vectors to a system and should be limited.  When connected to a domain, communication must go through the domain connection.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
