					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>A system faces an increased vulnerability threat if the built-in guest account is not disabled.  This account is a known account that exists on all Windows systems and cannot be deleted.  This account is initialized during the installation of the operating system with no password assigned.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
