				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Allowing anonymous access to named pipes or shares provides the potential for unauthorized system access.  This setting restricts access to those defined in "Network access: Named Pipes that can be accessed anonymously" and "Network access: Shares that can be accessed anonymously",  both of which must be blank under other requirements.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
