					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>The Create permanent shared objects user right must not be assigned to any groups or accounts.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Inappropriate granting of user rights can provide system, administrative, and other high level capabilities.

Accounts with the "Create permanent shared objects" user right could expose sensitive data by creating shared objects.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
