				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Inappropriate granting of user rights can provide system, administrative, and other high level capabilities.

Accounts with the "Create symbolic links" user right can create pointers to other objects, which could potentially expose the system to attack.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
